# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 2 (an element applied is a plain value, a description of the fields it was given) and ch. 4 (a pattern binds an element's field with its stack): `!r` is `1 on !press`, so each click adds 1; the description is never placed, so it takes no position.
test a_pattern_binds_an_event_field

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="press")
    1: Ui.Label(text="rang 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="rang 1")

tick 2
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    1: Ui.Label(text="rang 2")
